<body>
    <h1>Send money to mobile wallet (Kenya, Tanzania, Rwanda)</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 166.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 594.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><strong>Use case 9</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><strong>Send to Mobile Wallet (Airtel money /=
Mpe</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Actor(s)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Equity Chatbot System, Customer, Equity bank =
systems</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Use Case Overview</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Customer Wants to send Money to Airtel Money =
or Mpesa Wallet Using Equity bank Chatbot</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Preconditions</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li><p>Customer has self linked account on Chat bot</p></li>
<li><p>Customer Must have a Valid chatbot Pin</p></li>
</ol></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Termination Outcomes</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Condition Affecting Termination Outcomes</p><=
/td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li><p>Send Money to wallets success</p></li>
</ol></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li><p>Customer chatbot pin is valid</p></li>
<li><p>Customer account has sufficient funds for Send amount&nbsp; purchase=
 &amp; charges</p></li>
<li><p>Send amount is within the Wallet limits allowed</p></li>
<li><p>All Systems supporting chatbot are working</p></li>
</ol></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>2. Send money to wallet&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Fai=
lure</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li><p>Customer chatbot pin is Invalid</p></li>
<li><p>Customer bank account has insufficient funds for Send amount &amp; c=
harges</p></li>
<li><p>One or more Bank systems supporting chatbot are not working</p></li>
<li><p>Limits is below or above the top up limits</p></li>
</ol></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Description of Termination outcome #1</p></td=
>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><strong><u>Send Money Wallet</u></strong></p>
<ol>
<li><p>Customer Opens Equity Bank Chat bot on social media platform of choi=
ce (Whats app, Facebook, telegram, Siri)</p></li>
<li><p>Types a message to requests service of choice</p></li>
</ol><p><em>&lt;</em> <em>if the customer sends a message with a greeting &=
gt;</em></p><p><em>&nbsp;&nbsp; The bot will display a list of services the=
 customer to select from</em></p>
<ol>
<li><p>Balance Inquiry</p></li>
<li><p>Mini Statement</p></li>
<li><p>Full Statement</p></li>
<li><p>Send Money</p></li>
<li><p>Buy Airtime</p></li>
<li><p>Link Additional Account</p></li>
</ol><p><strong>3</strong>. The Customer responds with 5 Send money</p><p>{=
Where would you like to send money to</p>
<ol>
<li><p>Send Money to Equity&nbsp; bank account</p></li>
<li><p>Send money to Own bank account</p></li>
<li><p>Send money to Other bank account</p></li>
<li><p>Send to Mobile wallet}</p></li>
</ol><p><strong> 4. </strong>Customer select Send to Mobile wallet and subm=
it</p><p><em>&lt;if the customer sends a message asking for a specific serv=
ice&gt;</em></p><p><em>The Bot will skip the above step (2) where the custo=
mer is prompted to select a service and the bot will respond with prompts f=
or the requested service.</em></p><p><em>Eg Send to Mobile wallet&nbsp;</em=
></p><p><em> {Select</em></p>
<ul>
<li><p><em>Favorite</em></p></li>
<li><p><em>Enter recipient details}</em></p></li>
</ul><p><em>If the customer select favourite they will be presented with a =
list of saved favorites to select from, after selecting a favorite the syst=
em will skip all other steps upto step (8) and promt to enter amount</em></=
p><p><strong>5. </strong>Customer select enter recipient details and submit=
</p><p>{Select Telco mobile wallet service</p>
<ol>
<li><p>Telco 1</p></li>
<li><p>Telco 2}</p></li>
</ol><p><strong>6</strong>. The customer respond with Preferred wallet and =
submit</p><p>{Enter recipient mobile number - Mobile number format&nbsp;07x=
x, xxx, xxx, 2547xx, xxx xxx}</p><p><strong>7</strong>. Customer enter reci=
pient mobile number &amp; submit</p><p>&nbsp;{Enter Amount to send}</p><p><=
strong>8</strong>. Customer enter amount to Send&nbsp;&amp; Submit</p><p>(A=
mount can be in digits or in words, and amount will be in transacting accou=
nt currency)</p><p>{Select Account to send from</p>
<ul>
<li><p>Account Number 1}</p></li>
</ul><p><strong>9</strong>. customer select the account to transact from &a=
mp; submit</p>
<ol>
<li><p>066 xxxx xxxx xx</p></li>
<li><p>066 xxxx xxxx xx</p></li>
</ol><p><strong>10</strong>. Customer is prompted to confirm the transactio=
n details and enter pin via a Secure link&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>(Customer=
 redirected to confirm transaction and enter transacting PIN)</p><p><em>{Pl=
ease enter your Eva pin</em></p><p><em>[Delete]}</em></p><p><strong>11</str=
ong>. Customer enter Eva PIN (PIN is automatically submitted)</p><p>Custome=
r receives a successful Message notification&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>CONFIRMED. (=
Ksh) ${amount} sent to Telco mobile [recipients mobile] Ref [reference numb=
er] on ${dd/mm/yy} at ${hh:mm:ss: ss: ss).</p><p>Customer account is debite=
d &amp; respective Mobile wallet float Bank GL is credited; the beneficiary=
 wallet is credited</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;=
</p><p>Transaction Flows</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><strong><u>Send Money to wallets transaction =
type</u></strong></p>
<ol>
<li><p>Debit Party; Customer, Customer account</p></li>
<li><p>Credit Party; Office GL; Wallet Float GL</p></li>
<li><p>Amount: Send money amount&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol><p><strong><u>Send Money to wallets transaction type: Charges &amp; Ex=
cise duty</u></strong></p>
<ol>
<li><p>Debit Party; Customer, Customer account&nbsp;</p></li>
<li><p>Credit Party; Office GL; Commission account</p></li>
<li><p>Amount: As defined through fee configuration -Currently Zero rated</=
p></li>
</ol><p><strong><u>Excise duty (EOD) -Currently @XX%</u></strong></p>
<ol>
<li><p>Debit Party; Office GL; Commission account,</p></li>
<li><p>Credit Party; Office GL; Excise duty account</p></li>
<li><p>Amount: XX% of charges</p></li>
</ol></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Description of termination outcome #2</p></td=
>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>In case of Wrong chatbot pin, insufficient fu=
nds, Limits violations or the systems have an issue chat bot system will re=
spond with an appropriate failure response</p>
<ol>
<li><p><strong>Wrong PIN Notification</strong>: You have entered the wrong =
PIN, kindly try again later&nbsp;</p></li>
<li><p><strong>System Delays</strong>: Your request has been received. Proc=
essing might take longer than usual, due to system delays being experienced=
 at the moment. Apologies for any Inconveniences.</p></li>
<li><p><strong>System Failure:</strong> Failed. We are not able to complete=
 your request at the moment. Please try again later.</p></li>
</ol></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Use Case Associations</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>The relationship is one to one as the custome=
r can only Send money&nbsp; once at a time</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Business Rules Kenya</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"white" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li><p>Customer chatbot pin must be valid</p></li>
<li><p>Customer account must have sufficient funds for send amount&nbsp; &a=
mp; charges</p></li>
<li><p>Send Money minimum transaction limits&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol><p> a)&nbsp;&nbsp;Airtel / Mpesa&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ksh 100</p><p> =C3=
=98&nbsp; Must be Configurable parameters</p><p> 4. Send Money Maximum tran=
saction limits (Normal customers category)</p><p> a)&nbsp;Ksh 35,000 Per tr=
ansaction</p><p> b)&nbsp;Ksh 70,000 per day</p><p> 5. Send Money Maximum tr=
ansaction limits&nbsp;&nbsp; (Gold customers category)</p><p> a)&nbsp;Ksh 7=
0,000 Per transaction</p><p> b)&nbsp;Ksh 140,000 per day</p><p> =C3=98&nbsp=
; Configurable parameters</p><p> 6. Transaction count</p><p> =C3=98&nbsp; C=
onfigurable parameter</p><p> 7. System must auto reverse Failed transaction=
s</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Business Rules Tanzania</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"white" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li><p>Customer chatbot pin must be valid</p></li>
<li><p>Customer account must have sufficient funds for send amount&nbsp; &a=
mp; charges</p></li>
<li><p>Send Money minimum transaction limits&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol><p> a)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Airtel / Mpesa&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Tsh 10=
00</p><p> =C3=98&nbsp; Must be Configurable parameters</p><p> 4. Send Money=
 Maximum transaction limits</p><p> a)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Tsh 2000000 P=
er transaction</p><p> 5. Transaction count</p><p> =C3=98&nbsp; Configurable=
 parameter</p><p> 6. System must auto reverse Failed transactions</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Business Rules Rwanda</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"white" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li><p>Customer chatbot pin must be valid </p></li>
<li><p>Customer account must have sufficient funds for send amount &amp; ch=
arges </p></li>
<li><p>Send Money minimum transaction limits </p></li>
</ol><p> a) Airtel /MTN RWF 100 </p><p> =EF=83=98 Must be Configurable para=
meters </p><p> 4. Send Money Maximum transaction limits </p><p> a) RWF 2000=
000 Per transaction </p><p> 5. Transaction count </p><p> =EF=83=98 Configur=
able parameter </p><p> 6. System must auto reverse Failed transactions</p><=
/td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Charges&nbsp;Kenya</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Graduated: 1% of Send amount capped @ 25 Ksh =
+20% exercise duty + Termination fee (36)</p><p><strong>NB: </strong>Termin=
ation fee =3D Ksh 36 (<em>I.e. &nbsp;(30ksh + 20% Excise duty =3D Ksh 36)</=
em></p>
<ul>
<li><p>Bank charges =3D 1% of send amount capped @ Ksh 25 + excise duty @20=
% =3D Ksh 30 (Max)</p></li>
<li><p>Total Maximum charges =3D KSh&nbsp; 66,</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Charges Tanzania</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Graduated</p><p>FIGURE IN TZS</p><span class=
